on, especially when a gathering is about to turn hostile.","category":"social"}],"home_location_id":"loc_the_hollow","faction_id":"fac_hollow_circle"}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_vesper_adrien","source_character_id":"chr_vesper_quill","target_character_id":"chr_adrien_sorell","relationship_type":"investigator","description":"Vesper investigates Adrien's murder and must decide whether his evidence implicates only Marcen or also institutions she serves."},{"id":"rel_adrien_marcen","source_character_id":"chr_adrien_sorell","target_character_id":"chr_marcen_vell","relationship_type":"adversary","description":"Adrien's effort to expose manipulated tolls threatens Marcen's position and leads Marcen to arrange his murder."},{"id":"rel_marcen_tamsin","source_character_id":"chr_marcen_vell","target_character_id":"chr_tamsin_reed","relationship_type":"coercer","description":"Marcen pressures Tamsin to surrender Adrien's ledger key, using the Cartel's grain levy as leverage against the Hollow."},{"id":"rel_tamsin_adrien","source_character_id":"chr_tamsin_reed","target_character_id":"chr_adrien_sorell","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Tamsin was Adrien's trusted witness and holds the key he entrusted to her before his death."},{"id":"rel_vesper_marcen","source_character_id":"chr_vesper_quill","target_character_id":"chr_marcen_vell","relationship_type":"adversary","description":"Vesper's investigation challenges Marcen's false account of Adrien's death and his control of the toll records."},{"id":"rel_vesper_tamsin","source_character_id":"chr_vesper_quill","target_character_id":"chr_tamsin_reed","relationship_type":"investigator_witness","description":"Vesper needs Tamsin's testimony and ledger key, while Tamsin must decide whether to trust an investigator tied to the Bridge Wardens."}]}
