 from suggestion.","category":"mental"},{"name":"Pattern comparison","description":"Finds discrepancies and recurring details across written accounts without assuming they share a cause.","category":"mental"}]},{"id":"chr_nessa_orr","name":"Nessa Orr","role":"supporting","description":"A patient at the asylum on The Hollow, Nessa once kept grain tallies for the Hollow Circle and learned to notice small changes in routine. She is compact and pale from years spent indoors, with close-cropped hair and a habit of folding her hands as if holding an invisible ledger. Her dream is the same impossible scene described by the other patients, but she records its details in her own terse, orderly phrases.","motivation":"Have her account taken seriously without being treated as either a liar or a specimen.","goal":"Get Ilyan to preserve the patients' separate versions of the dream before the administrator can dismiss their similarities as contagion.","flaw":"She withholds crucial details until she is certain that speaking will not cost her control.","internal_conflict":"She wants help understanding the dream, yet fears that disclosure will let others claim ownership of her memories.","external_conflict":"The administrator's effort to contain discussion of the shared dream threatens Nessa's chance to have her account compared with those of the other patients.","arc":"Nessa begins by keeping the most disturbing detail of her dream to herself, convinced that silence is her only protection. When Ilyan preserves her unedited account despite the administrator's demand, she chooses to share the detail and let the other patients compare it with their own. She ends with less control over what the dream means, but more agency in how her experience is heard.","home_location_id":"loc_the_hollow","faction_id":"fac_hollow_circle","personality_traits":["watchful","methodical","guarded","steadfast"],"abilities":[{"name":"Exact recall","description":"Remembers sequences and repeated details with