out safety, but willing to combine procedure with the judgment of those who must act.","personality_traits":["methodical","direct","patient","cautious"],"abilities":[{"name":"Cable inspection","description":"Identifies stress and wear in cloudstone bridge cables before they become dangerous.","category":"technological"},{"name":"Debt accounting","description":"Tracks the labour or goods owed for skybridge crossings within the season.","category":"mental"}],"home_location_id":"loc_emberroost","faction_id":"fac_bridge_wardens"}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_mara_cael","source_character_id":"chr_mara_vel","target_character_id":"chr_cael_vel","relationship_type":"estranged siblings","description":"Mara Vel and Cael Vel are estranged siblings whose opposing fleet commands turn old family loyalty into a direct conflict during the Toll War."},{"id":"rel_cael_mara","source_character_id":"chr_cael_vel","target_character_id":"chr_mara_vel","relationship_type":"rivals","description":"Cael Vel sees Mara Vel as both his most perceptive rival and the one opponent whose judgment could make him question the Cartel's blockade."},{"id":"rel_olin_mara","source_character_id":"chr_olin_rusk","target_character_id":"chr_mara_vel","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Olin Rusk advises Mara Vel on bridge safety and wind-debt, challenging her to include her crew in decisions that affect their survival."}]}
